{"ep": "25", "idx": 0, "start": "0:00:04.34", "end": "0:00:09.93", "style": "aneluya1", "actor": "NTP", "text": "朝比奈实玖瑠的冒险"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 1, "start": "0:01:42.40", "end": "0:01:44.50", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "她的名字叫做朝比奈实玖瑠"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 2, "start": "0:01:44.84", "end": "0:01:48.36", "style": "zhushi", "actor": "NTP", "text": "白菜一棵半价！ 限时优惠"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 3, "start": "0:01:45.32", "end": "0:01:48.36", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "乍看起来是个非常普通  健康而可爱的少女"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 4, "start": "0:01:48.55", "end": "0:01:51.77", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "但实际上  她是来自未来的战斗女服务生"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 5, "start": "0:01:52.41", "end": "0:01:56.25", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "为什么来自未来  还要扮作女服务生？\n这些鸡毛蒜皮的小事根本没有意义"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 6, "start": "0:01:56.92", "end": "0:02:03.09", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "所谓故事  往往就是在一开始\n就亮出毫不讲理的奇怪设定的"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 7, "start": "0:02:05.20", "end": "0:02:07.27", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "非常抱歉打扰各位了！"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 8, "start": "0:02:07.83", "end": "0:02:11.33", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "今天进了很多非常好吃的白菜！"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 9, "start": "0:02:12.28", "end": "0:02:14.31", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "限定降价一个小时"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 10, "start": "0:02:15.22", "end": "0:02:17.62", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "限每人一棵的半价优惠！"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 11, "start": "0:02:18.90", "end": "0:02:21.62", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "另外  虽说是战斗女服务生"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 12, "start": "0:02:21.98", "end": "0:02:25.02", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "为什么现在却很冒失地穿着兔女郎装呢？"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 13, "start": "0:02:25.60", "end": "0:02:31.38", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这是因为平时她在当地的商店街\n做招揽顾客的打工并潜伏在这里"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 14, "start": "0:02:31.92", "end": "0:02:36.10", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "哎呀  今天白菜很便宜呢"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 15, "start": "0:02:38.37", "end": "0:02:39.91", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "要快点去买啊"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 16, "start": "0:02:42.41", "end": "0:02:45.39", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "实玖瑠！今天也很努力呢"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 17, "start": "0:02:45.62", "end": "0:02:47.18", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "是  是的！我会努力的！"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 18, "start": "0:02:48.10", "end": "0:02:51.03", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "实玖瑠穿着太过「努力」的衣装\n开朗地回答着"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 19, "start": "0:02:51.52", "end": "0:02:54.93", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "由于她纯洁的魅力  白菜一天就卖光了"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 20, "start": "0:02:56.43", "end": "0:02:57.85", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "总是要麻烦你啊"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 21, "start": "0:02:58.23", "end": "0:03:01.01", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "虽然不多  但是请收下这个吧"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 22, "start": "0:03:01.68", "end": "0:03:03.31", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "哪里  没关系的"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 23, "start": "0:03:04.90", "end": "0:03:06.84", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我才向您道歉"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 24, "start": "0:03:08.20", "end": "0:03:10.46", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "因为我只能做这些事了…"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 25, "start": "0:03:16.88", "end": "0:03:21.35", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那么  接下来我必须去肉店那里了"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 26, "start": "0:03:21.63", "end": "0:03:22.60", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "告辞…啊"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 27, "start": "0:03:23.78", "end": "0:03:24.75", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "告辞了！"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 28, "start": "0:03:27.22", "end": "0:03:31.47", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "她现在已经是\n这条商店街上不可或缺的吉祥物"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 29, "start": "0:03:31.75", "end": "0:03:33.99", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "被住在附近的人们所热爱着"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 30, "start": "0:03:34.54", "end": "0:03:35.35", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "加油吧  实玖瑠！"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 31, "start": "0:03:35.98", "end": "0:03:40.12", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "为商店街夺回  被去年建成的大型百货商场所抢走的客人吧"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 32, "start": "0:03:41.13", "end": "0:03:45.88", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "地方的经济活力和个体店铺的命运  就寄托在实玖瑠的双肩上"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 33, "start": "0:03:46.19", "end": "0:03:48.97", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "但是  这些和这次的故事完全没有关系"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 34, "start": "0:03:54.29", "end": "0:03:55.73", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那么  进入正题"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 35, "start": "0:03:56.40", "end": "0:03:58.30", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "当然她是个战斗女服务生"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 36, "start": "0:03:58.77", "end": "0:04:03.87", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "而她的任务则是在暗中保护某一位少年"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 37, "start": "0:04:05.04", "end": "0:04:07.40", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那位少年叫做古泉一树"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 38, "start": "0:04:07.96", "end": "0:04:10.57", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "看起来是个非常普通的乐天派高中生"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 39, "start": "0:04:10.75", "end": "0:04:12.47", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "但其实是超能力者"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 40, "start": "0:04:13.07", "end": "0:04:15.39", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "但是他本人却还没有发现这一点"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 41, "start": "0:04:16.01", "end": "0:04:17.54", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "看来好像是因为某个契机"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 42, "start": "0:04:17.76", "end": "0:04:22.10", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "使他体内潜藏着的超级未知力量觉醒了"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 43, "start": "0:04:26.31", "end": "0:04:27.01", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "虽然不知为什么"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 44, "start": "0:04:27.30", "end": "0:04:31.59", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "看起来像是\n无法向憧憬的学长打招呼的学妹一样"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 45, "start": "0:04:31.90", "end": "0:04:35.66", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "总之先视为\n看到一树平安无事而感到安心的表现吧"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 46, "start": "0:04:36.68", "end": "0:04:40.63", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "在这之后  仍穿着这样\n不成体统的衣服继续打工的实玖瑠"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 47, "start": "0:04:41.28", "end": "0:04:45.39", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "终于回到了现在为实玖瑠提供住所的文具店"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 48, "start": "0:04:49.09", "end": "0:04:50.46", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "啊  欢迎回来"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 49, "start": "0:04:51.56", "end": "0:04:53.41", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "实玖瑠  你累了吧？"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 50, "start": "0:04:54.10", "end": "0:04:55.63", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "啊  我没关系的"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 51, "start": "0:04:56.12", "end": "0:04:58.02", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "今天客人很多…"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 52, "start": "0:04:58.89", "end": "0:05:00.39", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "生意非常好！"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 53, "start": "0:05:01.09", "end": "0:05:04.62", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "啊  那真是太好了"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 54, "start": "0:05:15.55", "end": "0:05:17.06", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "今天的工作做完了"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 55, "start": "0:05:17.76", "end": "0:05:20.70", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "实玖瑠终于脱下了那身难堪的衣服"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 56, "start": "0:05:21.20", "end": "0:05:23.73", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "穿上了轻松的家居服"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 57, "start": "0:05:25.15", "end": "0:05:28.41", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我可以保证  换衣服的场景就只拍了这么多"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 58, "start": "0:05:28.59", "end": "0:05:30.05", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "就算来制作组要也是没用的"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 59, "start": "0:05:30.41", "end": "0:05:31.47", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不是骗人的"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 60, "start": "0:05:38.74", "end": "0:05:42.20", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "站在那里丝毫不动的是长门有希"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 61, "start": "0:05:42.71", "end": "0:05:45.99", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "虽然既不普通  看上去也不像普通少女"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 62, "start": "0:05:46.34", "end": "0:05:47.33", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不过你看得没错"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 63, "start": "0:05:47.67", "end": "0:05:49.55", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "其实她是邪恶魔法师"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 64, "start": "0:05:49.81", "end": "0:05:50.66", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "而且是外星人"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 65, "start": "0:05:52.37", "end": "0:05:53.47", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "但是我想说"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 66, "start": "0:05:53.76", "end": "0:05:58.22", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "从这个镜头看来  \n这位有希似乎也对一树有什么企图"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 67, "start": "0:05:58.52", "end": "0:06:02.28", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "可是从时间推断  \n这时候一树早已放学回家了"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 68, "start": "0:06:02.93", "end": "0:06:04.75", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "并且刚才商店街还是黄昏"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 69, "start": "0:06:04.93", "end": "0:06:06.53", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "现在的日光却烈得像正午"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 70, "start": "0:06:07.01", "end": "0:06:08.28", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "随便更改剧情的时间点安排是没关系"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 71, "start": "0:06:08.46", "end": "0:06:11.23", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "但还是希望导演和脚本能够为后期剪辑考虑一下"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 72, "start": "0:06:12.58", "end": "0:06:15.74", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "于是就这样\n实玖瑠和有希开始了第一次的对决"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 73, "start": "0:06:16.22", "end": "0:06:19.53", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "从这两人相遇到成为宿敌的所有过程"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 74, "start": "0:06:20.01", "end": "0:06:23.64", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "由于种种原因\n都只能请各位观众自己想象了"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 75, "start": "0:06:24.15", "end": "0:06:27.81", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这里如果能令各位了解本作的制作方针的话"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 76, "start": "0:06:28.03", "end": "0:06:29.11", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那就再好不过了"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 77, "start": "0:06:34.09", "end": "0:06:34.82", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "古泉同…"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 78, "start": "0:06:35.86", "end": "0:06:39.29", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "一树先生我是绝不会交给你的！"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 79, "start": "0:06:39.97", "end": "0:06:41.75", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我来保护他！"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 80, "start": "0:06:49.84", "end": "0:06:50.65", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "请让我来说明"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 81, "start": "0:06:51.04", "end": "0:06:52.74", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这个欠缺创意的棒子"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 82, "start": "0:06:53.09", "end": "0:06:56.24", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "是一把叫做什么「Staring Inferno」的魔杖"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 83, "start": "0:06:58.23", "end": "0:07:00.37", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "既  既然如此  只好用我的绝技了！"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 84, "start": "0:07:04.16", "end": "0:07:07.05", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "实  实  实玖瑠光束！"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 85, "start": "0:07:07.85", "end": "0:07:08.63", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我来说明吧"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 86, "start": "0:07:09.00", "end": "0:07:12.32", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "实玖瑠光束\n是从朝比奈实玖瑠的左眼中射出的"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 87, "start": "0:07:12.55", "end": "0:07:14.53", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "非常危险的必杀光束"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 88, "start": "0:07:14.95", "end": "0:07:15.57", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "Cut！Cut！"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 89, "start": "0:07:15.63", "end": "0:07:19.14", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这之后事情到底会如何急转直下呢？"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 90, "start": "0:07:16.68", "end": "0:07:18.75", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我说有希  你在做什么啊！"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 91, "start": "0:07:18.85", "end": "0:07:20.73", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我可没让你做这个啊"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 92, "start": "0:07:18.93", "end": "0:07:21.05", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你做什么啊！长门！"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 93, "start": "0:07:19.36", "end": "0:07:20.61", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "最后实玖瑠的命运会如何呢？"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 94, "start": "0:07:21.03", "end": "0:07:22.74", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "一树是为了什么而出现的呢？"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 95, "start": "0:07:25.53", "end": "0:07:27.01", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这  这  这家店铺…"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 96, "start": "0:07:27.85", "end": "0:07:31.01", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "呃…店主非常亲切！"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 97, "start": "0:07:31.95", "end": "0:07:33.63", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "而且  是个好人！"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 98, "start": "0:07:34.54", "end": "0:07:38.53", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "现在的店主荣二郎先生\n在他祖父时代就开始经营这家店"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 99, "start": "0:07:39.33", "end": "0:07:43.36", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "在这里  从干电池到冰箱  什么都能买到！"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 100, "start": "0:07:45.60", "end": "0:07:47.30", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "呃  下面是…"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 101, "start": "0:07:48.10", "end": "0:07:52.35", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "总  总之  大森电器店  请多关照！"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 102, "start": "0:07:56.02", "end": "0:07:59.19", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "和有希初次对决被击败的实玖瑠在烦恼着"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 103, "start": "0:08:00.78", "end": "0:08:03.42", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "实玖瑠光束竟然对她没有用…"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 104, "start": "0:08:04.18", "end": "0:08:05.44", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我一定要想办法"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 105, "start": "0:08:11.62", "end": "0:08:14.01", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "看起来实玖瑠并不是变身超人"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 106, "start": "0:08:14.12", "end": "0:08:15.44", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "也是需要换衣服的"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 107, "start": "0:08:16.91", "end": "0:08:20.20", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "而且看来今天也还是要去打工的"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 108, "start": "0:08:22.24", "end": "0:08:26.44", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这个时候一树还是\n带着一成不变的空虚表情走在路上"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 109, "start": "0:08:32.68", "end": "0:08:33.60", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "来者何人？"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 110, "start": "0:08:34.85", "end": "0:08:38.30", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我是会用魔法的外星人"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 111, "start": "0:08:40.00", "end": "0:08:41.04", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "是吗"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 112, "start": "0:08:42.28", "end": "0:08:42.87", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "是的"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 113, "start": "0:08:43.91", "end": "0:08:45.22", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你找我有什么事？"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 114, "start": "0:08:46.75", "end": "0:08:49.45", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你有潜藏着的力量"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 115, "start": "0:08:49.73", "end": "0:08:51.60", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我是为它而来的"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 116, "start": "0:08:52.37", "end": "0:08:54.68", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "如果我拒绝帮你的话  你会怎么样？"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 117, "start": "0:08:55.84", "end": "0:09:00.34", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "就算是使用强硬手段  我也要得到你"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 118, "start": "0:09:01.41", "end": "0:09:03.78", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "强硬手段是什么意思？"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 119, "start": "0:09:03.93", "end": "0:09:04.84", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "就是这个意思"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 120, "start": "0:09:06.34", "end": "0:09:07.11", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "危险！"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 121, "start": "0:09:13.60", "end": "0:09:14.65", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "好痛…"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 122, "start": "0:09:14.99", "end": "0:09:18.25", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我  我不会让你为所欲为的！"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 123, "start": "0:09:19.08", "end": "0:09:21.40", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这次我先放过你"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 124, "start": "0:09:21.94", "end": "0:09:24.23", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不过下次就不会这样了"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 125, "start": "0:09:24.92", "end": "0:09:28.75", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "先准备好你的谥号吧"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 126, "start": "0:09:29.36", "end": "0:09:34.13", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "下次我一定会毫不留情地击败你"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 127, "start": "0:09:41.43", "end": "0:09:42.82", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你是谁？"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 128, "start": "0:09:45.27", "end": "0:09:47.78", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我是偶然路过的兔女郎"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 129, "start": "0:09:47.97", "end": "0:09:49.14", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "只是这样而已"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 130, "start": "0:09:49.46", "end": "0:09:50.51", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那么再见了"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 131, "start": "0:09:57.80", "end": "0:09:59.63", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那个人到底是…"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 132, "start": "0:10:00.50", "end": "0:10:04.56", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "一树没有意义地\n装出不可思议的表情目送实玖瑠离开"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 133, "start": "0:10:04.93", "end": "0:10:06.36", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不过这个镜头上升有什么意义？"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 134, "start": "0:10:07.26", "end": "0:10:09.79", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这里又省略了很多剧情"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 135, "start": "0:10:10.01", "end": "0:10:15.09", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "在种种波折之后\n两个人又定下了决斗的日期吧  大概"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 136, "start": "0:10:15.71", "end": "0:10:18.92", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我  我  我是不会因为这点小事而输掉的！"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 137, "start": "0:10:19.65", "end": "0:10:21.15", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "邪恶宇宙人有希同学！"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 138, "start": "0:10:22.53", "end": "0:10:26.21", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "快乖乖地离开地球吧！"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 139, "start": "0:10:29.59", "end": "0:10:32.30", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你才应该离开这个时代"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 140, "start": "0:10:33.12", "end": "0:10:35.33", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我们要定他了"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 141, "start": "0:10:36.25", "end": "0:10:38.53", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "他有十分贵重的价值"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 142, "start": "0:10:38.96", "end": "0:10:40.32", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "作为这个计划的一环"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 143, "start": "0:10:40.76", "end": "0:10:42.63", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "首先我们要侵略地球"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 144, "start": "0:10:43.06", "end": "0:10:45.28", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我  我不会允许你做这种事的！"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 145, "start": "0:10:45.77", "end": "0:10:47.62", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "就算拼上我的生命！"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 146, "start": "0:10:48.35", "end": "0:10:51.41", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那么  你的生命我们就收下了"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 147, "start": "0:11:01.80", "end": "0:11:03.93", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "啊  啊  鹤屋同学"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 148, "start": "0:11:04.05", "end": "0:11:05.34", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "没想到连你都…"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 149, "start": "0:11:06.09", "end": "0:11:07.64", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "请清醒过来吧！"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 150, "start": "0:11:10.95", "end": "0:11:12.91", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你穿成这副样子还说这种话…"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 151, "start": "0:11:14.94", "end": "0:11:16.17", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "实玖瑠  抱歉啦"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 152, "start": "0:11:16.47", "end": "0:11:18.44", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我是被操纵的"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 153, "start": "0:11:19.45", "end": "0:11:21.11", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "真的对不起哦～"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 154, "start": "0:11:22.73", "end": "0:11:27.12", "style": "zhushi", "actor": "NTP", "text": "好了  实玖瑠  觉悟吧！"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 155, "start": "0:11:22.85", "end": "0:11:27.09", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "由于从那个叫做什么「Staring Inferno」\n的东西中发射出的魔力还是电波之类"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 156, "start": "0:11:27.32", "end": "0:11:30.17", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "鹤屋同学和另外两个人丧失了自我意识"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 157, "start": "0:11:30.31", "end": "0:11:31.86", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "好像变成线操人偶一样"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 158, "start": "0:11:32.40", "end": "0:11:33.83", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这样实玖瑠无法对他们下手"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 159, "start": "0:11:34.10", "end": "0:11:34.97", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "要怎么办？实玖瑠！"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 160, "start": "0:11:38.72", "end": "0:11:39.61", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "一点办法也没有"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 161, "start": "0:11:41.24", "end": "0:11:41.95", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "怎么了？"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 162, "start": "0:11:43.55", "end": "0:11:45.38", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "请抓住我  冷静点"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 163, "start": "0:11:47.13", "end": "0:11:51.19", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "顺便说一句\n突然出现的一树之前到底躲在什么地方呢？"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 164, "start": "0:11:51.47", "end": "0:11:53.54", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "感觉刚才好像不小心拍到了…"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 165, "start": "0:11:55.25", "end": "0:11:56.64", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "好冷哦…"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 166, "start": "0:11:57.43", "end": "0:12:00.24", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你究竟在这里做什么？"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 167, "start": "0:12:01.15", "end": "0:12:03.07", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "咦？啊  那个…"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 168, "start": "0:12:03.80", "end": "0:12:06.61", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我被坏人扔到池塘里了…那个…"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 169, "start": "0:12:07.49", "end": "0:12:08.98", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "现在该晕倒了！"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 170, "start": "0:12:09.24", "end": "0:12:11.21", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "啊…晕～"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 171, "start": "0:12:11.85", "end": "0:12:12.93", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "请振作点！"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 172, "start": "0:12:13.48", "end": "0:12:17.94", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "一般来说应该是去叫救护车\n或者到附近的人家里求助"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 173, "start": "0:12:18.34", "end": "0:12:21.41", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "但是这个少年\n却把失去意识的纯洁无垢的美少女"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 174, "start": "0:12:21.62", "end": "0:12:24.99", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "用抱公主的姿势抱起来\n到底想带到哪里去啊  你这混蛋"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 175, "start": "0:12:25.29", "end": "0:12:30.36", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "还有刚才还在一旁的有希他们也不来\n给她最后一击  到底消失到哪里去了？"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 176, "start": "0:12:31.01", "end": "0:12:34.12", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "放着各种各样的谜团和矛盾不解释"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 177, "start": "0:12:34.61", "end": "0:12:36.85", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这个故事终于演到了一半"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 178, "start": "0:12:37.20", "end": "0:12:39.12", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "…什么  难道说这个还有下一半吗？"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 179, "start": "0:12:45.43", "end": "0:12:47.70", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "看来这里是一树的家"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 180, "start": "0:12:48.37", "end": "0:12:50.22", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "比起这个更加令我介意的是…"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 181, "start": "0:12:50.55", "end": "0:12:53.96", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "被抱进这里来的实玖瑠的\n这身虽然比以前那些正常得多的衣服"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 182, "start": "0:12:54.12", "end": "0:12:58.65", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "该不会是一树趁着她昏倒的时候…\n带她去洗澡了吧…"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 183, "start": "0:12:58.80", "end": "0:12:59.92", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不  一定是这样！"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 184, "start": "0:13:00.45", "end": "0:13:06.05", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那么  这时不论谁\n都会把疑惑和震怒转化为强烈的杀意吧"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 185, "start": "0:13:06.39", "end": "0:13:10.55", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "但是我们应该压下纷涌的感情  不要想太多"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 186, "start": "0:13:10.93", "end": "0:13:16.51", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "因为登场的人物\n不存在做出我们预想范围内行动的可能"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 187, "start": "0:13:25.11", "end": "0:13:26.81", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "…等下  你突然想要做什么！"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 188, "start": "0:13:27.24", "end": "0:13:28.56", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "如果再把你的脸贴过去的话"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 189, "start": "0:13:28.85", "end": "0:13:32.34", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "就会有拍摄预定之外的人物\n冲出来把你踢飞的！喂！"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 190, "start": "0:13:32.87", "end": "0:13:33.73", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "等一下"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 191, "start": "0:13:36.26", "end": "0:13:40.56", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "古泉一树  你不应该选择她"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 192, "start": "0:13:41.52", "end": "0:13:47.87", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你的力量必须和我在一起才能够使用出来"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 193, "start": "0:13:48.69", "end": "0:13:50.84", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "咦？这是怎么回事？"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 194, "start": "0:13:51.07", "end": "0:13:54.30", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你应该先因为\n有希突然从窗口冒出来而吃惊吧…"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 195, "start": "0:13:54.64", "end": "0:13:59.03", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我现在只能告诉你  你有两种选择"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 196, "start": "0:13:59.38", "end": "0:14:03.15", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "是和我一起让宇宙进化为它应有的姿态"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 197, "start": "0:14:03.79", "end": "0:14:07.42", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "还是作为她的同伴扼杀未来的可能性"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 198, "start": "0:14:08.77", "end": "0:14:11.07", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "一树开始认真地考虑起来"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 199, "start": "0:14:11.45", "end": "0:14:12.93", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不过刚才长门是…"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 200, "start": "0:14:13.28", "end": "0:14:16.05", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "有希是对着一树说这句台词的吧"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 201, "start": "0:14:17.09", "end": "0:14:17.79", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "原来如此"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 202, "start": "0:14:18.58", "end": "0:14:19.67", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "无论如何他都…"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 203, "start": "0:14:19.95", "end": "0:14:24.19", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不  在这个场景中是我\n那么我就是「钥匙」了吧"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 204, "start": "0:14:24.39", "end": "0:14:26.82", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "并且  这个「钥匙」本身没有任何效果"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 205, "start": "0:14:27.26", "end": "0:14:30.62", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "因为说到底钥匙只是打开门的手段而已"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 206, "start": "0:14:31.01", "end": "0:14:33.84", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "打开那扇门的时候  会有什么改变吗？"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 207, "start": "0:14:34.03", "end": "0:14:35.97", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我想  改变的恐怕就是…"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 208, "start": "0:14:39.28", "end": "0:14:41.07", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这我明白了  有希"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 209, "start": "0:14:41.45", "end": "0:14:43.93", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "但是现在我并未拥有决定权"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 210, "start": "0:14:44.31", "end": "0:14:47.54", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我想现在得出结论还太早了"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 211, "start": "0:14:47.95", "end": "0:14:49.26", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我现在持保留意"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 212, "start": "0:14:49.45", "end": "0:14:50.82", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这次你就先回去吧？"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 213, "start": "0:14:51.00", "end": "0:14:54.18", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我们还需要考虑的时间"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 214, "start": "0:14:54.97", "end": "0:14:58.91", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "但如果你把所有的真相说出来的话\n就是另外一回事了"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 215, "start": "0:14:59.49", "end": "0:15:02.28", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那个时机不久之后就会来临吧"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 216, "start": "0:15:02.66", "end": "0:15:05.28", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "但是  的确并非现在"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 217, "start": "0:15:05.96", "end": "0:15:10.86", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我们习惯于把情报的不足视为最大的缺陷"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 218, "start": "0:15:11.68", "end": "0:15:13.29", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "在只有可能性的阶段"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 219, "start": "0:15:13.69", "end": "0:15:16.54", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "是不能做出任何明确地行动的"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 220, "start": "0:15:16.96", "end": "0:15:18.57", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "也许这就是所谓的伏线吧"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 221, "start": "0:15:18.84", "end": "0:15:20.60", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "总之在这不明所以的对话之后"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 222, "start": "0:15:21.00", "end": "0:15:25.21", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "一树和有希之间建立了某种共识"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 223, "start": "0:15:27.87", "end": "0:15:35.92", "style": "zhushi", "actor": "NTP", "text": "山土模型店"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 224, "start": "0:15:27.87", "end": "0:15:32.01", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这  这家模型店是山土启治先生（28岁）"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 225, "start": "0:15:32.33", "end": "0:15:35.92", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "去年毅然辞职之后开设的"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 226, "start": "0:15:36.78", "end": "0:15:40.58", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "可以说是为了追求个人的兴趣…\n而放手一搏的"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 227, "start": "0:15:41.90", "end": "0:15:44.73", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "果然  营业额没有像预期的一样提升…"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 228, "start": "0:15:45.47", "end": "0:15:54.37", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "呃…今年前期的…营业额只达到…  去年同期的…百分之80"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 229, "start": "0:15:54.51", "end": "0:15:57.12", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "所以请大家多多来购买吧！"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 230, "start": "0:16:00.53", "end": "0:16:02.32", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "咦？要我拿吗？"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 231, "start": "0:16:09.57", "end": "0:16:14.67", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不  不能对人射击！就对着空罐子打吧！"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 232, "start": "0:16:15.20", "end": "0:16:16.41", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "要  要打吗？"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 233, "start": "0:16:22.48", "end": "0:16:26.24", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那么  我想大家也都把\n原本的故事忘得差不多了"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 234, "start": "0:16:26.58", "end": "0:16:27.99", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "剧情突然开始了巨大转变"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 235, "start": "0:16:28.53", "end": "0:16:31.34", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "实玖瑠开始和一树同居了"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 236, "start": "0:16:31.73", "end": "0:16:35.96", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "几乎要让大家质疑\n之前的SF战斗有什么意义一般地"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 237, "start": "0:16:36.25", "end": "0:16:37.85", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "转变成了幼妻向的故事"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 238, "start": "0:16:38.11", "end": "0:16:39.39", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "难道说是想要利用萌元素"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 239, "start": "0:16:39.66", "end": "0:16:43.27", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "一口气把剧本中的\n松弛舒缓情节都解决掉吗？"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 240, "start": "0:16:45.94", "end": "0:16:47.81", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "还有这个家伙是谁啊？"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 241, "start": "0:16:46.06", "end": "0:16:48.47", "style": "zhushi", "actor": "NTP", "text": "来  三味  来打个招呼吧"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 242, "start": "0:16:48.06", "end": "0:16:49.56", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "是打算说成一树的妹妹吗？"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 243, "start": "0:16:48.84", "end": "0:16:49.48", "style": "zhushi", "actor": "NTP", "text": "来"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 244, "start": "0:16:49.82", "end": "0:16:53.10", "style": "zhushi", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我是三味线  多多指教！"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 245, "start": "0:16:49.83", "end": "0:16:51.13", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "还有这只猫…"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 246, "start": "0:16:51.48", "end": "0:16:53.10", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "之前不是趴在有希的肩膀上吗？"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 247, "start": "0:16:54.04", "end": "0:16:55.80", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "另一方面  有希也没有认输"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 248, "start": "0:16:55.98", "end": "0:16:58.36", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "竟然转学到一树的学校去了"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 249, "start": "0:17:01.12", "end": "0:17:05.02", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "有希想要使用美人计笼络一树"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 250, "start": "0:17:05.28", "end": "0:17:06.53", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "但是很奇怪的是"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 251, "start": "0:17:06.87", "end": "0:17:10.10", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "看起来她只是在用正统王道的方式\n追求一树而已…是错觉吗？"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 252, "start": "0:17:17.20", "end": "0:17:20.09", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "终于实玖瑠也转学到了同一所高中"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 253, "start": "0:17:23.31", "end": "0:17:24.99", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不过本来她的任务就是保护一树"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 254, "start": "0:17:25.16", "end": "0:17:29.45", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那么一开始就潜入这所高中\n不就可以了吗？但是也很难吐槽"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 255, "start": "0:17:29.78", "end": "0:17:33.34", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "总之有希和实玖瑠的战斗\n即使以恋爱喜剧的形式出现  也是十分激烈"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 256, "start": "0:17:33.49", "end": "0:17:35.76", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "已经可以说只是三角关系而已了…"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 257, "start": "0:17:38.96", "end": "0:17:40.08", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "正在这么想的时候"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 258, "start": "0:17:40.49", "end": "0:17:43.03", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不知是只在学校内结下停战协定"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 259, "start": "0:17:43.39", "end": "0:17:46.18", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "还是偶尔想起了自己的本职"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 260, "start": "0:17:46.51", "end": "0:17:49.75", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "两个人还是会扮成\n战斗女服务生和外星人魔法师的样子"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 261, "start": "0:17:49.91", "end": "0:17:51.83", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "展开间歇性地战斗"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 262, "start": "0:17:52.18", "end": "0:17:54.10", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "可以说  之后会有什么样的发展"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 263, "start": "0:17:54.52", "end": "0:17:56.42", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "即使遍览镜头也无法讨论出来"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 264, "start": "0:17:56.68", "end": "0:17:57.92", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "也不知是为谁而捏了一把汗"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 265, "start": "0:17:58.54", "end": "0:17:59.95", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "真是愈发泥沼化的剧情"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 266, "start": "0:18:09.54", "end": "0:18:15.12", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "然后  这个令人看不下去的故事  终于像是被腰斩一样迎来了最后的情节"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 267, "start": "0:18:15.48", "end": "0:18:20.94", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "恐怕这个作品的监督也觉得不管什么形式  一定要有个结尾吧"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 268, "start": "0:18:21.37", "end": "0:18:23.08", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "有点「已经太迟了」的感觉啊"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 269, "start": "0:18:23.41", "end": "0:18:26.23", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "总之有希要求和实玖瑠进行最终决战了"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 270, "start": "0:18:26.45", "end": "0:18:27.24", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "是这样啊！"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 271, "start": "0:18:27.72", "end": "0:18:29.23", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你刚才理解到什么了么…"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 272, "start": "0:18:30.25", "end": "0:18:31.43", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "怎么了  实玖瑠"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 273, "start": "0:18:31.72", "end": "0:18:34.55", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "一副被怪蜀黍跟踪一样的烦恼表情"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 274, "start": "0:18:34.90", "end": "0:18:36.86", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "有什么不好的预感吗？"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 275, "start": "0:18:39.22", "end": "0:18:41.15", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "终于到了这个时候了！"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 276, "start": "0:18:41.97", "end": "0:18:45.12", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我必须去迎接最后的战斗！"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 277, "start": "0:18:46.18", "end": "0:18:47.82", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "好厉害啊"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 278, "start": "0:18:48.04", "end": "0:18:49.69", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那就拜托你了  实玖瑠"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 279, "start": "0:18:49.90", "end": "0:18:51.12", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "地球就交给你…"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 280, "start": "0:18:51.71", "end": "0:18:54.86", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "很抱歉  总是在中途吐槽"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 281, "start": "0:18:54.03", "end": "0:18:55.19", "style": "zhushi", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我会努力的…"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 282, "start": "0:18:55.26", "end": "0:19:00.53", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "一般想来  实玖瑠认识鹤屋同学\n是她转学过来以后的事"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 283, "start": "0:19:00.84", "end": "0:19:06.42", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "但是之前在池塘边的战斗场面中\n鹤屋同学的出场就是明显的编排错误了吧…"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 284, "start": "0:19:06.79", "end": "0:19:07.37", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "还有…"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 285, "start": "0:19:07.73", "end": "0:19:10.09", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "一旦不知道怎么接上下面的剧情\n就只会拍摄天空么…"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 286, "start": "0:19:11.37", "end": "0:19:13.77", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "总而言之  终于到了高潮的场面"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 287, "start": "0:19:14.74", "end": "0:19:17.85", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "就在此把一切都结束吧"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 288, "start": "0:19:18.50", "end": "0:19:21.87", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我们剩下的时间不多了"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 289, "start": "0:19:22.39", "end": "0:19:25.47", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "必须在午间休息结束之前必须结束一切"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 290, "start": "0:19:25.82", "end": "0:19:28.70", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "虽然我也同意这一点  但是…"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 291, "start": "0:19:29.23", "end": "0:19:32.37", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "一树一定会说要选择我的"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 292, "start": "0:19:33.90", "end": "0:19:35.69", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我相信这一点！"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 293, "start": "0:19:35.98", "end": "0:19:40.52", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "虽然抱歉  但我无意尊重他的自由意志"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 294, "start": "0:19:41.03", "end": "0:19:43.17", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "他的力量我要定了"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 295, "start": "0:19:43.53", "end": "0:19:48.14", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那么赶快把一树抓起来不就好了…  这么想的只有我一个人吗？"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 296, "start": "0:19:48.27", "end": "0:19:49.83", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我是不会让你得逞的！"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 297, "start": "0:19:50.14", "end": "0:19:54.35", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我就是为了阻止你才从未来来到这里的！"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 298, "start": "0:20:01.70", "end": "0:20:02.66", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "嘿！"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 299, "start": "0:20:04.51", "end": "0:20:05.94", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "哈！"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 300, "start": "0:20:07.06", "end": "0:20:07.83", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "喝！"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 301, "start": "0:20:18.53", "end": "0:20:19.49", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "等一下  实玖瑠！"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 302, "start": "0:20:19.67", "end": "0:20:20.75", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "反击啊  快反击！"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 303, "start": "0:20:20.85", "end": "0:20:21.63", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "喂！你们在做…"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 304, "start": "0:20:22.07", "end": "0:20:23.77", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "用上了烟花爆竹"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 305, "start": "0:20:24.08", "end": "0:20:26.03", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "经过了老师的一顿臭骂之后"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 306, "start": "0:20:26.39", "end": "0:20:28.44", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "实玖瑠终于被逼到尽头了"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 307, "start": "0:20:30.17", "end": "0:20:31.50", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "好高啊…"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 308, "start": "0:20:32.41", "end": "0:20:34.58", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "现在是你偿还一切的时候了"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 309, "start": "0:20:35.10", "end": "0:20:36.43", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "认命吧"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 310, "start": "0:20:38.49", "end": "0:20:41.15", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "有希致命的一击袭向实玖瑠"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 311, "start": "0:20:41.69", "end": "0:20:43.62", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "画面上有点问题…"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 312, "start": "0:20:43.97", "end": "0:20:46.07", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "但是除了这里\n已经没有什么激动人心的场面了"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 313, "start": "0:20:46.32", "end": "0:20:47.97", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "所以就请各位自己想象吧"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 314, "start": "0:20:48.51", "end": "0:20:51.01", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "已经到了生死关头了！\n实玖瑠会怎么样呢！"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 315, "start": "0:20:55.73", "end": "0:20:56.61", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你没事吧"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 316, "start": "0:20:57.41", "end": "0:20:59.40", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "有希同学  请你住手吧"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 317, "start": "0:21:01.59", "end": "0:21:03.11", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你还没有想到吗"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 318, "start": "0:21:03.42", "end": "0:21:06.13", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "只要夺取这个少年的意志就可以了"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 319, "start": "0:21:03.82", "end": "0:21:05.45", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "喂  三味线别说话"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 320, "start": "0:21:05.68", "end": "0:21:06.83", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我叫你别说话！"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 321, "start": "0:21:07.12", "end": "0:21:11.33", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "据我所闻  你有这个能力…"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 322, "start": "0:21:12.95", "end": "0:21:14.60", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "刚才是我在用腹语术"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 323, "start": "0:21:16.69", "end": "0:21:19.03", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你接招吧  古泉一树"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 324, "start": "0:21:19.27", "end": "0:21:23.13", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你的意识也会被我所操控"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 325, "start": "0:21:25.04", "end": "0:21:25.58", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "嘿呀！"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 326, "start": "0:21:29.98", "end": "0:21:30.57", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "…遗憾"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 327, "start": "0:21:30.84", "end": "0:21:32.25", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "喵～"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 328, "start": "0:21:36.71", "end": "0:21:38.65", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "已经结束了  朝比奈同学"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 329, "start": "0:21:43.27", "end": "0:21:46.67", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "由于一树原理不明的超能力觉醒"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 330, "start": "0:21:46.97", "end": "0:21:49.79", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "有希被击飞到宇宙的彼端了"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 331, "start": "0:21:50.33", "end": "0:21:51.87", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "世界恢复和平了！"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 332, "start": "0:21:52.38", "end": "0:21:53.57", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "谢谢你  朝比奈实玖瑠"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 333, "start": "0:21:54.00", "end": "0:21:55.33", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "谢谢你  古泉一树"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 334, "start": "0:21:55.91", "end": "0:21:58.25", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "只要能完结就比什么都好"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 335, "start": "0:21:59.55", "end": "0:22:01.44", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "…不过  怎么最后又是一个镜头拉升"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 336, "start": "0:22:08.67", "end": "0:22:10.60", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "本作品纯属虚构"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 337, "start": "0:22:10.81", "end": "0:22:12.94", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "和实际存在的人物  团体"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 338, "start": "0:22:13.29", "end": "0:22:16.95", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "以及任何其它专有名词或现象完全无关"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 339, "start": "0:22:17.18", "end": "0:22:18.07", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "全都是骗人的"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 340, "start": "0:22:18.71", "end": "0:22:19.91", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "若有雷同之处"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 341, "start": "0:22:20.10", "end": "0:22:21.92", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "也只是偶然相似而已"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 342, "start": "0:22:22.16", "end": "0:22:23.81", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "啊  广告画面可是另当别论"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 343, "start": "0:22:23.98", "end": "0:22:26.95", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "请多关照大森电器店和山土模型店！"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 344, "start": "0:22:27.10", "end": "0:22:28.76", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "多多去买东西吧！"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 345, "start": "0:22:28.46", "end": "0:22:30.88", "style": "zhushi", "actor": "NTP", "text": "（试映中  禁止进入）"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 346, "start": "0:22:29.80", "end": "0:22:31.65", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "啊？再说一遍？"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 347, "start": "0:22:32.87", "end": "0:22:34.55", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "本作品纯属虚构"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 348, "start": "0:22:34.88", "end": "0:22:37.23", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "和实际存在的人物  团体…"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 349, "start": "0:22:37.67", "end": "0:22:41.34", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "…我说阿虚  为什么我非要说这个不可？"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 350, "start": "0:22:41.24", "end": "0:22:42.16", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "完成了！"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 351, "start": "0:22:41.77", "end": "0:22:42.64", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这不是理所当然的吗？"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 352, "start": "0:22:47.49", "end": "0:22:48.90", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这不是做得非常好吗！"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 353, "start": "0:22:49.09", "end": "0:22:52.08", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "SOS团的词典里没有「不可能」这个词！"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 354, "start": "0:22:52.18", "end": "0:22:53.06", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "对吧  阿虚？"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 355, "start": "0:22:53.79", "end": "0:22:56.28", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你就想把这种东西暴露于众目睽睽之下吗…"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 356, "start": "0:22:57.28", "end": "0:23:01.16", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这样一定能在文化祭里获得大好评  场场爆满的！"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 357, "start": "0:23:01.35", "end": "0:23:02.95", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "还是找个比较好的环境来播放吧…"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 358, "start": "0:23:03.09", "end": "0:23:05.01", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我们接下来就去找电影研究会交涉吧"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 359, "start": "0:23:05.15", "end": "0:23:05.86", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "只要把作品给他们一看…"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 360, "start": "0:23:05.90", "end": "0:23:09.38", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "今天把文化祭的事情忘掉  找个地方好好睡一觉吧"}
{"ep": "25", "idx": 361, "start": "0:23:10.02", "end": "0:23:10.74", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "对吧  阿虚！"}
